<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Affiche TDBR — découverte</title>
    <style>
        @page {
            size: A4 portrait;
            margin: 0;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            color: #2C2416;
            background: #fff;
            -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        }

        .page {
            width: 210mm;
            height: 297mm;
            position: relative;
            background: #FAF6EE;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .ribbon-top {
            position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 12mm; background: #2C2416;
        }
        .ribbon-bottom {
            position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 14mm; background: #8B7355;
        }

        .corner-deco {
            position: absolute;
            width: 60mm; height: 60mm;
            border-radius: 50%;
            opacity: 0.18;
        }
        .corner-deco.tr { top: -30mm; right: -30mm; background: #D4AF7A; }
        .corner-deco.bl { bottom: 14mm; left: -25mm; background: #D4AF7A; }

        /* En-tête */
        .header {
            position: absolute;
            top: 18mm; left: 0; right: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header img {
            max-height: 24mm;
            width: auto;
            display: inline-block;
        }
        .header .brand-fallback {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-weight: 900;
            font-size: 36pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.15em;
            color: #2C2416;
        }
        .header .tagline {
            margin-top: 3mm;
            font-size: 9.5pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.4em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8B7355;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        /* Intro plein largeur */
        .intro {
            position: absolute;
            top: 60mm;
            left: 22mm;
            right: 22mm;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .intro .salut {
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 18pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #2C2416;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 4mm;
        }
        .intro .body-text {
            font-size: 10.5pt;
            line-height: 1.55;
            color: #3D352A;
            max-width: 160mm;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        .intro .signature {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 3mm;
            font-style: italic;
            color: #8B7355;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 10.5pt;
        }

        /* Grille des 3 visuels */
        .samples {
            position: absolute;
            top: 130mm;
            left: 14mm;
            right: 14mm;
        }
        .samples-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 10pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.4em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8B7355;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 4mm;
        }
        .samples-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: separate;
            border-spacing: 4mm 0;
        }
        .samples-table td {
            width: 33.33%;
            text-align: center;
            vertical-align: top;
        }
        .sample-card {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 3mm;
            border: 1pt solid #E8DDC8;
        }
        .sample-card img {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: 50mm;
            object-fit: cover;
        }
        .sample-empty {
            background: #F5E6D3;
            border: 1pt dashed #D4AF7A;
            height: 50mm;
            line-height: 50mm;
            color: #8B7355;
            font-size: 9pt;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .sample-label {
            margin-top: 2.5mm;
            font-size: 11pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #2C2416;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }

        /* Filet décoratif */
        .divider {
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            margin-left: -25mm;
            width: 50mm;
            height: 1pt;
            background: #D4AF7A;
        }

        /* Bloc QR */
        .qr-zone {
            position: absolute;
            top: 207mm; left: 0; right: 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .qr-card {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 4mm;
            background: #fff;
            border: 2pt solid #2C2416;
        }
        .qr-card img {
            display: block;
            width: 38mm; height: 38mm;
        }
        .url {
            margin-top: 4mm;
            font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
            font-size: 20pt;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #2C2416;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
        }
        .url-prefix {
            font-size: 9.5pt;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #8B7355;
            letter-spacing: 0.3em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 1mm;
        }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 4mm; left: 0; right: 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #FAF6EE;
            font-size: 9pt;
            letter-spacing: 0.25em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        .footer strong { font-weight: 700; color: #fff; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
    <div class="ribbon-top"></div>
    <div class="corner-deco tr"></div>
    <div class="corner-deco bl"></div>
    <div class="ribbon-bottom"></div>

    {# Logo + tagline #}
    <div class="header">
        {% if logoBase64 %}
            <img src="{{ logoBase64 }}" alt="TDBR">
        {% else %}
            <div class="brand-fallback">TDBR</div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="tagline">Humour, fromage et jeux de société</div>
    </div>

    {# Intro #}
    <div class="intro">
        <span class="salut">TDBR, qui es-tu&nbsp;?</span>
        <div class="body-text">
            Je m'appelle Manu et je suis le créateur de <strong>TDBR</strong>.
            Je décline mes obsessions sur t-shirts, mugs et goodies&nbsp;:
            le <strong>fromage</strong> (toujours), les <strong>jeux de société</strong>,
            et plus largement les <strong>fanarts</strong> qui me font sourire.
            L'<strong>intelligence artificielle</strong> est mon partenaire de
            création — pour explorer plus de pistes et tester plus d'idées,
            sans jamais perdre la patte de chaque visuel.
            <span class="signature">— Manu</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# Filet sous l'intro #}
    <div class="divider" style="top: 122mm;"></div>

    {# Grille des 3 visuels d'illustration #}
    <div class="samples">
        <div class="samples-title">Quelques créations</div>
        <table class="samples-table">
            <tr>
                {% for sample in samples %}
                    <td>
                        <div class="sample-card">
                            {% if sample.image %}
                                <img src="{{ sample.image }}" alt="{{ sample.label }}">
                            {% else %}
                                <div class="sample-empty">À déposer</div>
                            {% endif %}
                        </div>
                        <div class="sample-label">{{ sample.label }}</div>
                    </td>
                {% endfor %}
            </tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    {# QR + URL #}
    <div class="qr-zone">
        <div class="qr-card">
            <img src="{{ qrDataUri }}" alt="QR code vers tedybear.fr">
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top:3mm;">
            <span class="url-prefix">Scannez ou tapez</span>
            <span class="url">{{ siteLabel }}</span>
        </div>
    </div>

    {# Footer #}
    <div class="footer">
        <strong>Découvrez la collection complète en ligne</strong>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
